      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 01:46:39 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>反对国防法案，民主党改变策略</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/politics/democrats-defense-bill.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[民主党跨越了曾经被视为政治红线，对这项通常是两党共同采取的措施投了反对票，表达了对伊朗战争的不同意见。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/politics/democrats-defense-bill.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 01:29:29 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普下令对“不准确”的史密森尼历史博物馆发出警告</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/arts/design/smithsonian-signs-trump-executive-order.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[特朗普总统表示，美国国家历史博物馆的标牌将纠正一份有争议的白宫报告所描述的“极端政治激进主义”。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/arts/design/smithsonian-signs-trump-executive-order.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 22:11:17 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普会见高级顾问，权衡伊朗局势重大升级</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/politics/trump-escalation-iran.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[特朗普总统坚称，美以在伊朗的战争将是一次相对较短的“旅行”，尽管它已经持续了近五个月，而且还看不到结束的迹象。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/us/politics/trump-escalation-iran.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 21:41:12 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>美国麻疹病例创历史新高</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/briefing/us-measles-cases-hit-a-record.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[此外，伊朗的威胁促使特朗普更换空军一号。这是周五结束时的最新消息。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/24/briefing/us-measles-cases-hit-a-record.html</guid>
